<Weight><T>Int</T><D>400</D></Weight></Item>
<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>The 1748 encoded symbols of subframes 2 and 3&#x000D;&#x000A; are combined and interleaved using a block &#x000D;&#x000A;interleaver. The block interleaver is conceptually &#x000D;&#x000A;described using a two-dimensional array of 38 &#x000D;&#x000A;rows and 46 columns.</DataEntry>
<TextParam><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></TextParam></Item></Item>
